5.在[核心定义]上方加入它可以几个醒目的字，[核心定义]内的内容开头用1.2.3.4....在开头标注， [总结提示]内的内容要颜色醒目\n5.  文字规则：所有正文左对齐，行间距宽松，重点文字用暖橙色，普通文字用深灰色，绝对不使用纯黑色\n6.  底部区：内容卡片最下方嵌入一张横版实景照片，照片四周保留统一白色内边距。\n[底部生活场景]：根据内容描述生成一张横板实景照片。\n7.  整体质感：干净、通透、温暖，无任何多余装饰，无水印"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "name": "COMBO", "links": [14], "type": "COMBO"}], "size": [402.65313720703125, 205.49224853515625], "pos": [1330.535400390625, 1451.0101318359375], "widgets_values": ["9:16", "fixed", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "PrimitiveNode", "title": "$sampler_name.select", "properties": {"Run widget replace on values": false}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [566.3038330078125, 685.7982788085938], "pos": [1286.7607421875, 1754.766845703125], "widgets_values": ["snake"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 11, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [9], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [478.1745300292969, 187.6737060546875], "pos": [545.6204833984375, 1238.85009765625], "widgets_values": ["[核心定义]：\n1.加速碳水和脂肪分解供能，告别午后犯困和慢性疲劳\n2.修复熬夜受损的神经细胞，改善焦虑烦躁和注意力不集中\n3.促进毛囊营养供给，减少压力性脱发和头发干枯分叉\n4.辅助维持皮肤黏膜健康，改善口角炎和皮肤出油问题\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "